  - `git status`
  - `git add .`
  - `git commit -m`
  - `git push`
- Set up GitHub repositories correctly.
- Configured `origin` and `upstream`.
- Learned how to receive trainer updates.
- Organized the project into:
  - Main project (`Playwright Test Leaf`)
  - Trainer repository (`PW-JS-JUL-26`)
- Created a strategy for maintaining one master notes file throughout the course.

